OL,15,     Gsociety for women and girls.
OL,16,G1600FUnder a Cloud
OL,17,     GThe poet laureate, Simon
OL,18,     GArmitage, has written about the
OL,19,     Gweather a lot. But in his work,
OL,20,     Gclouds form a backdrop. He's
OL,21,     Gbringing them to the fore and
OL,22,     Gconsidering their place in art.
